      "id": "claim_195a095c87ce4e988abcfa02d0e12073",
      "statement": "`ApplicationStore.get_json` returns `None` for missing objects, but it logs and re-raises `AccessDenied` instead of swallowing it, because that error may indicate either a real isolation violation or a misconfigured tag.",
